    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [X] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.git\n\n### Description\n\n`:Git show <commit> <file>`\r\nOpens <file> diff at commit but filetype of buffer is set to filetype of input <file>.\r\n\r\nFiletype is set to `git` when <file> is not given.\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.10\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. `nvim -nu minimal.lua`\r\n2. `:Git show <commit> <file>`\r\n\n\n### Expected behavior\n\n\"show\" buffer should have \"git\" filetype\n\n### Actual behavior\n\nexplained above",
