        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks foe the issue!\r\n\r\nI can reproduce. The idea is for `show` to [rely on `vim.filetype.match()`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/657ef75b52a548090fb7906735517b7ddbf39e88/lua/mini/git.lua#L1132), but I *think* there is something strange is going here. I'll take a look.",
            "created_at": "2024-07-25T14:38:52Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/1084#issuecomment-2250498489",
            "id": 2250498489,
